40.png", "id": "1490895785702131", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823746_1490895789035464_7831204702398728858_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5upTh5RMH1gQ7kNvwGJXLUx&_nc_oc=AdrzssH1uRxMenLfk_k2qtinV7jnYW9X07-pKM7laIKNX06dNk74ZI6ipi1Eg1kIEtM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFgqxKFxauOW2uXV-Fy22RcemqQWF3gGGtYAm9mTkAXrw&oe=6A897EA7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "CapMantle", "keywords": ["CapMantle", "gorillatagfangame"], "long_description": "Capmantle is a high\u2011momentum VR movement experience built for players who crave speed, mastery, and the thrill of outplaying their opponents through pure skill. Designed with a focus on fluid locomotion and competitive depth, Capmantle blends the familiar energy of tag\u2011based VR games with its own evolving identity, worldbuilding, and mechanical twists.\n\nAt its core, Capmantle is about movement as expression. Players run, climb, vault, swing, and improvise their way through handcrafted environments that reward creativity and precision. Every surface is an opportunity, every route a puzzle, and every chase a test of instinct. The game\u2019s physics\u2011driven locomotion system is tuned to feel intuitive for newcomers while offering a high skill ceiling for players who want to push the limits of what\u2019s possible.\n\nCapmantle\u2019s world is shaped by your vision \u2014 a place where style, speed, and strategy collide. Maps are built with verticality, flow, and readability in mind, giving players the freedom to chart their own paths while maintaining competitive clarity. Whether you\u2019re sprinting across rooftops, weaving through dense forest routes, or navigating tight indoor spaces, each environment is crafted to support fast decision\u2011making and dynamic chases.\n\nThe game\u2019s tag modes emphasize tension and adaptability. Being \u201cit\u201d isn\u2019t just a role \u2014 it\u2019s a mindset. You\u2019ll need to read movement patterns, predict routes, and use the environment to your advantage. Meanwhile, runners must stay unpredicta", "short_description": "Capmantle is a fast\u2011paced VR movement game where players sprint, climb, vault, and outsmart each other across a world built for pure momentum. With fluid locomotion, competitive tag modes, and a distinct identity shaped by your own creative direction, Capmantle delivers that high\u2011energy, skill\u2011based playground feeling while carving out its own style in the fangame scene. Every map, mechanic, and update pushes players to master movement and chase that next adrenaline rush."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1tt-E9mhat7THPRzP5Av1ThIE3-19pksfyRJKpzfuFmc/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "C00L STUDIOS And EDDYS DEV HUB", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://c00lstudios.lovable.app/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "25153680914303846"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "831233633235438"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "831233633235438"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1767378000, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "831233633235438"}]}, "liveChannel": {"no